+# Frozen mathematical preprocessing fixtures
+
+The six `.bin` files are synthetic inputs and complete native-observed per-call
+expectations. No biometric data, derived data, or biometric seeds were used.
+`provenance.json` records their SHA-256 identities, sizes, native observations,
+approved DLL identity, and generator source identities.
+
+See [the group README](../README.md) for exact layouts, chronology, scope and
+reproduction. Never regenerate expectations from current production output or
+replace these mathematical inputs with hardware captures.
